# The Next.js client currently requires no environment variables at runtime.
#
# The API proxy target (the Express backend URL) is configured directly in
# next.config.ts via rewrites() and is hardcoded to http://localhost:5000.
# If you need to point the client at a different backend host (e.g. for a
# non-local deployment), update the `destination` values in next.config.ts.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for future client-side configuration.
